{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874770/extras/7ee71174fe560b19adb3f2b9b429570c.poster.avif?t=1761369765\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874770/extras/7ee71174fe560b19adb3f2b9b429570c.webm?t=1761369765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pixel Tank Wars&quot; Is A Fast-Paced 2D Top-Down Twin-Stick Shooter That'S Easy To Pick Up, Quick To Play, And Full Of Laughs And Gunfire!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players Can Choose Their Own Tank Shape And Venue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Stand-Alone Local Multiplayer And Steam Remote Play, Up To 4 People Can Participate In The Melee</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable For Family Fun, As Well As Gatherings Between Veterans And Friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Game Takes Only A Few Minutes, Which Is Convenient For Controlling The Playing Time. You Can Start A Game Whenever You Want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Each Battle, Players Will Control The Tank To Shoot And Dodge Until There Is Only One Survivor Left On The Field Who Is The Winner!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, There Are Three Maps Available In The Game, Including Environments Of Different Styles And Interactive Scene Objects, Such As Obstacles And Props, Which Increase The Variability And Fun Of The Battle Situation.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874770?t=1761369765","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874770/a0c61430a07adbd1cc4f5dc0c3c868f94700a4ec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761369765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.st